1. FAIN, by team Makarouna Kadheba (IHEC CodeLab 2.0)
   https://github.com/Moetez-Fradi/IHEC-Code-Lab-Makarouna-Kadheba

   FAIN's README declares the MIT licence
   ("Copyright (c) 2026 Makarouna Kadheba - IHEC CodeLab 2.0"). Portions of
   this repository are adapted from FAIN under that licence:

   - frontend/ : the application shell, theme (light / dark), layout and the
     small UI components (cards, badges, tabs, stat tiles, chart tooltip),
     adapted from FAIN's ui/ folder;
   - backend/app/analytics/tunizi.py : the Arabizi digit table, the Tunizi
     market slang and the idea of mapping company nicknames to tickers,
     adapted from FAIN's sentiment-analysis service (the matching itself is
     rewritten).

   The assistant's knowledge base (backend/app/knowledge/) is written for this
   project; it is not taken from FAIN.

