2. Tradeili, by The Overfitters
   https://github.com/bechir23/ihec-fintech

   Tradeili has no licence file, so none of its files are copied here. Its
   ideas were reimplemented from scratch: the forecasting diagnostics (ADF
   stationarity, AIC / BIC model selection, walk-forward backtests), the
   five-agent pipeline with logged hand-offs and safety rules, the four-signal
   decision engine and learning from user feedback.

Market data: daily BVMT quotations (2016-2026) as published in the data folders
of both prototypes, cleaned by scripts/build_dataset.py.
